      "comment": "Mountain Shaper: Karst crawlers and Mt. Hulao's amber",
      "content": "Mountain Shaper planted karst crawlers across Mt. Hulao to keep its peace. The plant is mostly underground and makes amber when stepped on, trapping whatever trod on it, including would-be treasure hunters. The seeds are a cultivar of Madame Ping's, and the plant needs constant upkeep, which is why he sought a gentler variety from her.",
