      "comment": "Mountain Shaper: Qiqi and the amber seal",
      "content": "Character Story 4 relates that Qiqi, an herb-gatherer, strayed into the adepti's realm and died in the crossfire between adepti and demons, receiving a Vision in her last breath. The adepti gave her portions of their strength to revive her, but she went berserk and Mountain Shaper sealed her in amber.",
