      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Mountain Shaper: Moon Carver (Houzhang)",
      "content": "Moon Carver is the deer adeptus who sent the Traveler to Mt. Hulao. He and Mountain Shaper helped Rex Lapis seal Azhdaha, and in Lantern Rite events they travel in human guise as Houzhang and Jiehu. Cloud Retainer says the plan to plant mint on her mountain was theirs together.",
