        "Cloud Retainer",
        "Xianyun"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Mountain Shaper: Cloud Retainer (Xianyun)",
      "content": "Cloud Retainer, a fellow crane, lives on Mt. Aocang and later in Liyue Harbor as Xianyun. She scorns his mint and scolds him for disturbing her. In 6.3 (limited event) she banned him from Mt. Aocang for three days, and in 7.1 (limited event) she bristles at his gardening advice.",
