        "Streetward Rambler"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Mountain Shaper: Madame Ping",
      "content": "Madame Ping is the adeptus known as Streetward Rambler. Her plants are the source of his karst crawler seeds, and he asked her for a lower-maintenance variety. In 4.4 (limited event) Moon Carver recalls that she personally rescued him from a group of youths while he was in human guise.",
