    "6": {
      "uid": 6,
      "key": [
        "Zizhi",
        "Deadly Self"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Mountain Shaper",
        "Jiehu",
        "Cloud Retainer",
        "mint"
      ],
      "comment": "Mountain Shaper: Zizhi and the mint incident",
      "content": "In A Lanternlit Ode to the Silver Moon (6.3, limited-time event, now in the quest log) Zizhi, a Deadly Self of the White Horse Adeptus, possessed Gaming, then Mountain Shaper. Under her influence he went to plant mint on Mt. Aocang and boasted of it until the Traveler obtained Zizhi's essence. Coming to himself, he praised the Traveler for the mint seedlings and invited them to Mt. Hulao, until the Traveler told him he had planted them himself.",
