        "Gaming",
        "Paimon",
        "kite"
      ],
      "comment": "Mountain Shaper: Lantern Rite 4.4 visit",
      "content": "During Vibrant Harriers Aloft in Spring Breeze (4.4, limited event) Mountain Shaper and Moon Carver went to Liyue Harbor in human guise to find Cloud Retainer, who had not visited them. Paimon did not believe they were adepti until they told private stories. Jiehu cited the karst crawler seeds (or, if the Traveler had finished the 3.4 event, the cooking machine).",
